00:18:43,640 --> 00:18:44,900
快乐的鱼.
They wanna see Swimmy, the happy fish.

253
00:18:44,900 --> 00:18:45,000
迈克∶哦!哦!那好吧,我就演小黑鱼.
Mike: Oh, oh, alright, well Swimmy it is.

254
00:18:48,460 --> 00:18:50,780
试镜员∶很棒的选择.请坐.掰一片鱼翅.
Auditioner: Excellent choice.Have a seat.Break a fin.

255
00:18:50,780 --> 00:18:50,880
迈克∶请问这里有人坐吗?
Mike: Ah, is this seat taken?

256
00:19:11,280 --> 00:19:15,800
男人∶坐!坐!
Man: Sit!Sit!So,

257
00:19:15,800 --> 00:19:19,340
我试过镜的朋友跟我讲过他们的过程.他们会让你戴上鱼翅和鱼鳃,
my friend auditioned for this a little earlier and told me all about it.

258
00:19:19,480 --> 00:19:22,580
然后趴在地上咧开嘴笑,
They make you wear fins and gills and lie on your stomach and grin like

259
00:19:22,580 --> 00:19:23,680
在你的嘴里放个鱼钩,然后,
crazy, with a hook in your mouth,

260
00:19:23,680 --> 00:19:26,780
所有的薯条就开始唱,"我们的鱼一点也不臭!"
while all the chips sing, "our fish don't stink!"

261
00:19:26,780 --> 00:19:26,880
迈克∶啊,不过没有关系...呃...他们让我怎么做都行,因为经历过这个星期的难堪后,这些对我来说,已经没什么大不了的了.
Mike: Ah, well...err...hey, whatever they make me do is fine, 'cause after the way I've been humiliated this week, it doesn't matter.

262
00:19:26,880 --> 00:19:26,980
男人∶哇,你结婚了?看看那个鱼上的鳃!
Man: Wow, so you're married.Wow, look at the gills on that one!

263
00:19:43,360 --> 00:19:47,120
迈克∶嗨!等等!我认识他们.
Mike: Hey, wait a minute, I know them.What the heck are they doing here?

264
00:19:47,960 --> 00:19:50,640
他们在这里干嘛?他们不是都在参加戏剧的演出和夏季剧集的演出吗?那时我跟他们说这里有试镜的时候,
I mean, they've been in plays and summer stock,

265
00:19:50,680 --> 00:19:53,020
他们还都笑话过我呢.恩,
and they laughed at me when I told 'em about this audition.

266
00:19:53,740 --> 00:19:56,880
他们并不比我优秀.嗨,我真是个木头人!
I mean they're no better than I am.Hey, have I been a chump!

267
00:19:56,880 --> 00:19:56,980
试镜员∶注意啦!要开始拍摄小黑鱼的镜头了.
Auditioner: Come on people!The part of Swimmy has already been cast.

268
00:19:56,980 --> 00:19:57,080
演员们∶嘿!什么!
Actors: Hey!What!

269
00:20:00,720 --> 00:20:03,780
男人∶嗨,我已经连续吃了3天的虫子了!
Man: Hey, I've been eating worms for three days!

270
00:20:06,080 --> 00:20:08,580
教授∶先生.再来一次,
Professor: Once again gentlemen, very clever material!

271
00:20:09,000 --> 00:20:10,980
很聪明的材料!希望我的小黑鱼能够进入你的视线.
Just hope my swimming lives up to your vision.

272
00:20:14,340 --> 00:20:17,260
托尼∶你相信那个骗子!!
Tony: Do you believe that guy, what a phony!!

273
00:20:17,760 --> 00:20:21,560
凯:他可不是看上去的样子.
Kay: He's not what he seemed at all, m Apparently not a lot of people are.

274
00:20:21,560 --> 00:20:21,660
托尼∶迈克?
Tony: Mike?

275
00:20:21,660 --> 00:20:21,760
迈克∶啊……让我们重新认识一下吧.我是迈克西维尔,我长这么大,在高中的时候演过两不戏.
Mike: Ah...why don't we just start over.My names Mike Seaver, I've done two plays in my whole life, both of them at high school.

276
00:20:21,760 --> 00:20:21,860
托尼∶托尼dissipio,并且我有做夏季剧集.我负责布景.
Tony: Tony Dissipio, and I have done summer stock.I built scenery.

277
00:20:21,860 --> 00:20:21,960
凯∶凯特麦克旦尼尔,我并不习惯真实的演出,因为这样很费时间.我想要表演.
Kay: Kate McDonnell, and I'm not used to this honesty stuff, it's gonna take a while.I wanna act.

278
00:20:48,060 --> 00:20:48,660
托尼∶我也是.
Tony: Me too.

279
00:20:49,440 --> 00:20:50,120
迈克∶我也是.
Mike: Me too.

280
00:20:50,660 --> 00:20:52,540
男人∶嗨,
Man: Hey, I just called my service;

281
00:20:52,620 --> 00:20:55,040
我刚才给服务台打电话了;据说纽约动物园正在找长的像海象的人.我觉得自己不适合,
New York Zoo is looking for people that look like walruses.

282
00:20:55,420 --> 00:20:58,300
但是我认为你可以去!!
It's not right for me, but I figured I'd toss it your way!!

283
00:20:58,300 --> 00:20:58,400
杰森∶做了早餐.
Jason: Make breakfast.

284
00:20:58,400 --> 00:20:58,500
麦琪∶煮了咖啡.
Maggie: Make coffee.

285
00:20:58,500 --> 00:20:58,600
迈克∶呵呵,不必担心,我不是刚从外面回来,行不?
Mike: Oh, you guys, don't worry, I'm not just getting home, OK?

286
00:21:11,500 --> 00:21:13,800
杰森∶不必担心;我们信任你.
Jason: Don't worry, we believe you.

287
00:21:13,900 --> 00:21:16,980
麦琪∶恩,我只是很欣慰,
Maggie: Yeah.I'm just thrilled that you're excited about your class...

288
00:21:17,260 --> 00:21:18,100
你开始重视所有的课程了.
any class.

289
00:21:18,920 --> 00:21:20,620
迈克∶呵呵,你说对了.
Mike: Hey, you bet, and you know, thanks and...

290
00:21:20,620 --> 00:21:25,000
不过我还是要谢谢你们,给我机会自己做决定,这些经历真的让我的生活发生了变化.
You guys letting me make that decision on my own, it's really changed my life.

291
00:21:25,580 --> 00:21:28,800
麦琪∶迈克,我想我们现在终于可以说对你是完全信任的了.
Maggie: Well Mike, I guess we can finally say that we trust you.

292
00:21:29,220 --> 00:21:30,220
迈克∶哦!谢谢妈妈.
Mike: Oh, well thanks, Mom.

293
00:21:31,840 --> 00:21:35,100
女孩1∶迈克!!!我们还在等你的咖啡呢.
Girl: Mike!!!We're still waiting for the coffee.

294
00:21:35,100 --> 00:21:35,200
迈克∶来了,来了,再等一分钟.
Mike: Oh...err...just one minute.

295
00:21:35,200 --> 00:21:35,300
杰森∶再等一秒钟!
Jason: Just one second!

296
00:21:41,720 --> 00:21:43,100
女孩2∶我现在可以出来了吗?
Girl 2: Can I come out now?

297
00:21:44,240 --> 00:21:48,360
迈克∶哦!出来吧!哦,让我来帮你.
Mike: Oh, there you are!Oh, hey, let me help you out.

298
00:21:48,780 --> 00:21:50,720
好了,就在这里吧,我马上就上来了.
Here, come on out here.I'll be right up, OK?

299
00:21:51,180 --> 00:21:52,140
麦琪∶迈克……
Maggie: Look, Mike...

300
00:21:52,140 --> 00:21:52,240
迈克∶妈妈,爸爸,听我说,你知道吗?如果你们没有让我自己拿主意的话,在这样的情况下我可能觉得有必要跟你们解释,可是,现在我不必了.
Mike: Mom, Dad, listen, you know if I weren't in that stage in life where you trusted me and wanted me to make my own decisions, I would feel the need to explain here...but I don't.

301
00:21:52,240 --> 00:21:52,340
杰森∶嘿!站住!
Jason: Hey, hold on!

302
00:21:52,340 --> 00:21:52,440
麦琪∶你认为你可以在没有……把她带出去吗?
迈克∶知道了!
00:21:36,100
Maggie: Do you think you can walk out of her without.. Mike: Got ya!
